new Condominium Management company in Portugal.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"muraRyu\\\"},{\\\"demo\\\":\\\"Demo\\\",\\\"github\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://victo.pages.dev\\\",\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/screenshots/victo.webp\\\",\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Gallery website built to showcase the works of the famous Portuguese artist Victó.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"victó's art gallery\\\"},{\\\"demo\\\":\\\"Demo\\\",\\\"github\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://insurbia.com\\\",\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/screenshots/insurbia2.webp\\\",\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Website developed to be be contact point for the arquitecture collective Insurbia.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"insurbia\\\"}],\\\"websites-title\\\":\\\"Websites\\\"},\\\"privacyPolicy\\\":{\\\"contactEmail\\\":\\\"gdpr@daniel-freire.com\\\",\\\"header1\\\":\\\"1. Introduction\\\",\\\"header10\\\":\\\"10. Updates to This Privacy Policy\\\",\\\"header11\\\":\\\"11. Contact Us\\\",\\\"header2\\\":\\\"2. Information We Collect\\\",\\\"header3\\\":\\\"3. Purpose of Data Collection\\\",\\\"header4\\\":\\\"4. Legal Basis for Processing\\\",\\\"header5\\\":\\\"5. Sharing of Personal Data\\\",\\\"header6\\\":\\\"6. Data Retention\\\",\\\"header7\\\":\\\"7. Your Rights\\\",\\\"header8\\\":\\\"8. Data Security\\\",\\\"header9\\\":\\\"9. Complaints\\\",\\\"paragraph1\\\":\\\"Welcome to Daniel Freire's website. We are committed to protecting your personal information and your right to privacy. If you have any questions or concerns about this privacy notice or our practices with regard to your personal information, please contact us at\\\",\\\"paragraph10\\\":\\\"We may update this privacy policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new privacy policy on this page.\\\",\\\"paragraph11\\\":\\\"If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at\\\",\\\"paragraph2\\\":\\\"We collect personal information that you voluntarily provide to us when you fill out a form on our website. The personal information we collect includes:\\\",\\\"paragraph2li\\\":[\\\"First name\\\",\\\"Last name\\\",\\\"Email address\\\",\\\"Phone number\\\"],\\\"paragraph3\\\":\\\"The information we collect will be used to contact you in the future. We will only use your personal data for this specific purpose.\\\",\\\"paragraph4\\\":\\\"We process your personal data based on your consent, which you provide by filling out the form on our website.\\\",\\\"paragraph5\\\":\\\"We do not share your personal data with third parties except as required by law.\\\",\\\"paragraph6\\\":\\\"We will retain your personal data only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes we collected it for, including for the purposes of satisfying any legal requirements.\\\",\\\"paragraph7\\\":\\\"You have the right to:\\\",\\\"paragraph7li\\\":[\\\"Access your personal data\\\",\\\"Request correction of your personal data\\\",\\\"Request erasure of your personal data\\\",\\\"Object to processing of your personal data\\\",\\\"Request restriction of processing your personal data\\\",\\\"Request transfer of your personal data\\\",\\\"Withdraw consent at any time\\\"],\\\"paragraph8\\\":\\\"We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to ensure a level of security appropriate to the risk of processing your personal data.\\\",\\\"paragraph9\\\":\\\"If you believe that we have not complied with data protection laws, you have the right to lodge a complaint with the relevant supervisory authority.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Privacy Policy for Daniel Freire's Website\\\"},\\\"services\\\":[{\\\"icon\\\":\\\"/images/icons/business-processes.svg\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Tailored web applications — CRMs, dashboards, and internal tools that fit how your business actually works.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Business Custom Software\\\"},{\\\"icon\\\":\\\"/images/icons/ai-recommend.svg\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Integrating AI into your workflows — chatbots, intelligent automation, and data-driven features.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"AI Solution Implementation\\\"},{\\\"icon\\\":\\\"/images/icons/dns-services.svg\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Modern, performant websites and applications built with React, Next.js, and TypeScript.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Web Development\\\"},{\\\"icon\\\":\\\"/images/icons/ibm-watson--machine-learning.svg\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Data-backed audits, performance optimization, and strategy to help your business get found.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"SEO \\u0026 Technical Consulting\\\"}],\\\"sidenav\\\":{\\\"footer\\\":{\\\"blurb\\\":\\\"Made with 🐞 by\\\",\\\"icons\\\":{\\\"github\\\":{\\\"alt\\\":\\\"GitHub\\\",\\\"ariaDetails\\\":\\\"Daniel Freire's GitHub\\\",\\\"ariaLAbel\\\":\\\"Daniel Freire's GitHub\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://github.com/danielfreire-dev/\\\",\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/icons/github-square.svg\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Daniel Freire's GitHub\\\"},\\\"linkedin\\\":{\\\"alt\\\":\\\"LinkedIn\\\",\\\"ariaDetails\\\":\\\"Daniel Freire's Linkedin\\\",\\\"ariaLAbel\\\":\\\"Daniel Freire's Linkedin\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/danielfreire-swe/\\\",\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/icons/linkedin.svg\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Daniel Freire's Linkedin\\\"}}},\\\"header\\\":{\\\"role\\\":\\\"web developer\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"daniel freire\\\"},\\\"legal\\\":{\\\"impressumLink\\\":\\\"/impressum\\\",\\\"impressumName\\\":\\\"impressum\\\",\\\"privacyLink\\\":\\\"/privacy-policy\\\",\\\"privacyLinkAriaDetails\\\":\\\"Privacy Policy\\\",\\\"privacyLinkAriaLabel\\\":\\\"Privacy Policy\\\",\\\"privacyLinkTitle\\\":\\\"Privacy Policy\\\",\\\"privacyName\\\":\\\"privacy policy\\\"},\\\"links\\\":[{\\\"link\\\":\\\"/\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"home\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"/about\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"about\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"/portfolio\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"portfolio\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"/contact\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"contact\\\"}],\\\"privacy\\\":\\\"privacy policy\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"Daniel Freire ® all rights reserved\\\",\\\"select\\\":{\\\"languageSelectAriaLabel\\\":\\\"Select Language Menu\\\",\\\"languageSelectTitle\\\":\\\"Select Language Menu\\\"}},\\\"tech\\\":[{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://nextjs.org\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/nextjs-13.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"next.js\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"Nextjs\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://react.dev\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/react2.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"react.js\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"Reactjs\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://nodejs.org/en\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/node-js.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"node.js\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"Nodejs\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://www.typescriptlang.org\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/Typescript.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"typeScript\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"TypeScript\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/javascript-original.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"javaScript\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"JavaScript\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://www.w3.org/html/\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/html5-original-wordmark.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"HTML5\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"HTML5\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/Official_CSS_Logo.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"CSS3\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"CSS3\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://www.postgresql.org\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/postgresql.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"postgreSQL\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"PostgreSQL\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://vite.dev\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/vitejs.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"vite.js\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"Vitejs\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://webpack.js.org/\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/webpack.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"webpack\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"Webpack\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://github.com/\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/github.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"gitHub\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"Github\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://git-scm.com/\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/git-scm-icon.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"git\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"Git\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://vitest.dev/\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/vitest.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"vitest\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"Vitest\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://jestjs.io/\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/jestjsio-icon.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"jest\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"Jest\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://selenium-python.readthedocs.io/\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/selenium.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"selenium\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"Selenium\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://www.python.org/\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/python-original.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"python\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"Python\\\"},{\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://www.linux.org/\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/images/icons/linux-original.svg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"linux\\\",\\\"svgr\\\":\\\"Linux\\\"}],\\\"topMainPage\\\":{\\\"blurbsArray\\\":[{\\\"description\\\":\\\"Is your website holding back your business growth? Our comprehensive performance audit deeply analyzes your technical infrastructure, user experience, and conversion potential. We’ll provide a detailed report highlighting critical improvements that can dramatically boost your online performance.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Revolutionize Your Digital Presence Now!\\\"},{\\\"description\\\":\\\"Websites require constant care to stay secure, functional, and competitive. Our comprehensive maintenance packages offer proactive monitoring, immediate issue resolution, and continuous technological updates.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Unlock Your Website’s Full Potential\\\"},{\\\"description\\\":\\\"Stop settling for generic templates. Our custom web development services create fully tailored digital experiences that align perfectly with your brand’s unique identity and business goals. We transform your concept into a powerful, responsive, and cutting-edge web solution.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Build Your Dream Project Today\\\"},{\\\"description\\\":\\\"Speed isn’t just a feature—it’s a competitive advantage. Our performance optimization service ensures your website loads extremely fast, delivering an exceptional user experience that keeps visitors engaged and converts more effectively.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Accelerate Your Website’s Potential\\\"},{\\\"description\\\":\\\"Technology evolves rapidly. Our specialized migration services help you transition seamlessly to modern, efficient web technologies without disrupting your existing operations. We ensure a smooth, risk-managed upgrade path.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Modernize Your Digital Infrastructure\\\"},{\\\"description\\\":\\\"Websites require constant care to remain secure, functional, and competitive. Our comprehensive maintenance packages offer proactive monitoring, immediate issue resolution, and continuous technological updates.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Ongoing Care for Your Digital Assets\\\"}],\\\"p1\\\":\\\"Tired of software that holds your business back?\\\",\\\"p2\\\":\\\"Most business software is either too rigid or too complex. I specialize in developing custom web applications—like CRM systems, project trackers, and data dashboards—that fit how your business actually works. If you need a tool that solves a specific problem without unnecessary features, let’s discuss what you’re trying to achieve.\\\"}},\\\"now\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"timeZone\\\":\\\"Europe/Lisbon\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"$L14\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"15:I[59,[\\\"694\\\",\\\"static/chunks/694-009548b009ecd054.js\\\",\\\"908\\\",\\\"static/chunks/908-6bb2778964e2ca03.js\\\",\\\"51\\\",\\\"static/chunks/51-063b24f715f61199.js\\\",\\\"261\\\",\\\"static/chunks/261-e6773460e5f3e14a.js\\\",\\\"450\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/%5Blocale%5D/layout-6b5f594b50a93f99.js\\\"],\\\"Providers\\\"]\\n16:I[5564,[\\\"694\\\",\\\"static/chunks/694-009548b009ecd054.js\\\",\\\"908\\\",\\\"static/chunks/908-6bb2778964e2ca03.js\\\",\\\"51\\\",\\\"static/chunks/51-063b24f715f61199.js\\\",\\\"261\\\",\\\"static/chunks/261-e6773460e5f3e14a.js\\\",\\\"450\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/%5